# proto-message: nexteggapp.taxprotos.common.v1.FormMapping
#
# What Form ND-1 calls each concept, per tax year.
#
# Lines come from the 2025 Form ND-1 as the North Dakota Office of State Tax
# Commissioner publishes it. There are no amount codes: IRS Publication 1220
# covers the information returns the IRS receives electronically, and a state
# return is not one of them.

